# Not only tidiness: rattler-build copies this directory into the built
# package's info/recipe/, honouring the enclosing git work tree's ignore rules.
# Measured 2026-08-25 -- without these three lines (or when building outside a
# git checkout) info/recipe/ also carries both staged binaries, a second
# compressed copy of ~20 MB in each of the five packages.  release-nunchaku.yml
# asserts info/recipe holds nothing but *.yaml, so a lost line here is a red
# leg rather than a silent doubling.
nunchaku-bin
smbc-bin
*.sha256.txt
